      ],
      "reader_note": "For Curis in 2019 and 2020, the filing excludes potential common-stock equivalents because their effect would be anti-dilutive in the reported loss periods. Dollar losses are displayed in thousands; share counts and per-share data are unscaled. The historical filing's full weighted-average shares and reported USD EPS are retained without converting them to a later share basis.",
